<title>HUNGARY: BALATON FUSZERT H1 LOSSES UP, SALES DOWN.</title>
<headline>BALATON FUSZERT H1 LOSSES UP, SALES DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30.</p>
<p>(Figures in thousands of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating result	    104,406 loss vs     40,092 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		188,758 loss vs    132,653 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue	 2,457,364	vs  2,955,235</p>
<p>    Other revenue		  35,054	vs	3,553</p>
<p>    Directs costs of sales  2,446,476	vs  2,921,178</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales   102,272	vs    142,345</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   48,076	vs     22,941</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 84,393 loss vs     89,472 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     741	vs	1,397</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    85,134	vs     90,869</p>
<p>    Extraordinary result	     41	vs	3,089 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Balaton Fuszert Kereskedelmi Rt is a regional</p>
<p>retailer. The figures were calculated in accordance with</p>
<p>Hungarian Accounting Standards and are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
